# ☕ Java Basics — Day 1

## 1. Print a Name

### Code

```java
package p1;

public class PrintAName {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        String name = "Nikitha";

        System.out.println("Name = " + name);
    }
}
```

### Output

```text
Name = Nikitha
```

### Important Points

* `String` stores text.
* `System.out.println()` prints output.
* `+` joins strings and variables.
* Java statements end with `;`.

