## 3. Even or Odd

### Code

```java
package p1;

public class EvenOrOdd {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        int num = 17;

        if (num % 2 == 0) {
            System.out.println("Num is Even");
        } else {
            System.out.println("Num is Odd");
        }
    }
}
```

### Output

```text
Num is Odd
```

### Important Points

`%` gives the remainder.

```text
20 % 2 = 0 → Even
17 % 2 = 1 → Odd
```

