## 4. Positive, Negative or Zero

### Code

```java
package p1;

public class PNZ {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        int a = -5;

        if (a > 0) {
            System.out.println("Positive");
        } else if (a < 0) {
            System.out.println("Negative");
        } else {
            System.out.println("Zero");
        }
    }
}
```

### Output

```text
Negative
```

### Important Points

```text
a > 0  → Positive
a < 0  → Negative
a == 0 → Zero
```

