## 7. Sum from 1 to N

### Code

```java
package p1;

public class S1toN {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        int sum = 0;

        for (int i = 1; i <= 5; i++) {
            sum = sum + i;
        }

        System.out.println("Sum = " + sum);
    }
}
```

### Output

```text
Sum = 15
```

### Dry Run

```text
sum = 0

i = 1 → sum = 1
i = 2 → sum = 3
i = 3 → sum = 6
i = 4 → sum = 10
i = 5 → sum = 15
```

### Important Pattern

```java
int sum = 0;

for (...) {
    sum = sum + value;
}
```

This is a **running sum**.

