## 8. Multiplication Table

### Code

```java
package p1;

public class M7 {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        int num = 7;

        for (int i = 1; i <= 10; i++) {
            System.out.println(num * i);
        }
    }
}
```

### Output

```text
7
14
21
28
35
42
49
56
63
70
```

### Important Point

Keep `num` unchanged:

```java
System.out.println(num * i);
```

Don't do:

```java
num = num * i;
```

because that changes `num` during every iteration.

### `print()` vs `println()`

```java
System.out.print()
```

→ Same line

```java
System.out.println()
```

→ New line

